                                                "text": "1998, Ricardo Corona, \"These Esses\" (\"Eses esses\"), in Other Shores (Outras Praias), translated by Ricardo Corona & Charles Perrone\nthese esses / change in design / and senses themselves / $ // it's as if / the ess / were the sounds / of success"
